Package: cytokineR
Title: Transparent, Modular Pre-Processing of Multiplex Cytokine Data
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Anders Hagen", "Jarmund", , "ajarmund@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import, quality control, plate and batch correction, calibration
    (fluorescence intensity to concentration), and imputation of censored values
    for bead-based multiplex immunoassays such as Bio-Rad Bio-Plex and Luminex
    xMAP. Every processing step is a registered, swappable method that records
    its parameters and estimates, so a full pre-processing pipeline can be
    inspected, reproduced and extended. Alternatives to fragile per-plate
    standard curves are provided (multiple-of-blank, multiple-of-standard,
    control-anchored ratios, shared-shape calibration across plates), together
    with a benchmarking framework that scores competing pipelines on held-out
    replicate material with scale-free metrics, a waterfall lattice that
    shows how much each step contributes in every combination of the other
    steps, and a simulator with known ground truth for method development.
